      "source_text": "果然得送些和气槽同学有关系的吧？\r\n或者～……嗯……\r\n训练员，你有什么想法吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "979b61213381aa947322ba8fbb61d8a1a7627234615f04cf303d40530fb83dd0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
