    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6f461a5676ee42b4f845604",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知道空运能不能运送料理呢……\r\n总之做了再说吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "600b63fcdb3f8641a306bf85d27f24ecc17ed6a292c1ddc9afe237b1fd744282",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022520.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b98230db18a56403eb22fa1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……看来气槽又得辛苦一阵子了。\r\n不过能听见这样温馨的姐妹故事，\r\n我心中的满足感改过了罪恶感……",
      "source_fingerprint": "644c28fbbbd331d9f3ba6b8f257c73e801b127fe69a566dfa27b52b79787a9cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022520.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56497f113f5a8df6b573566d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "活用她在日本比赛的经验，写封挑战书告诉她姐\r\n姐将来赛场上再见……同为运动员，\r\n美妙姿势的姐姐应该会相当高兴吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "707542186d97fe1050aea12516a543b4051f6c0c31120d91f53027bb3ca3e37d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022520.json",
      "json_path": [
