    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3a225caf4b8a00698e21713",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听上去好有趣呀！\r\n而且对支持我来留学的姐姐而言，\r\n这应该是最棒的谢礼了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "813e3468015df9fadf0e81070bd286a73eecd970a97b0a6c791d914a9abfde55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
