      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "笨蛋，你面前不就有个对略懂养花的人吗。\r\n交给我吧。有什么不懂的东西直接问我就行，\r\n别客气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10d3908faade6bc857d8e982c8cf84764d06d5e3163a54ec1de900a22f8f6a50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
